{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "polisos",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# PolisOS\n\nRomania civic operating-system blueprint\n\nA shared coordination and feedback layer. Voluntary, rights-bound, nationally accessible.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "citizens",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Citizens\n\nRights, accessibility, opt-in data, scoped project roles.\n\n[Citizen rights](../citizens/README.md)",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "governance",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Authority\n\nProjects have accountable owners. National governance proposal requires legal review.\n\n[Governance](../governance/README.md)",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Problem to project\n\nObserve → evidence → review → options → authorize → deliver → evaluate.\n\n[First workflow](../first-workflow/README.md)",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "data",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Data and measurement\n\nOpt-in citizen data; separate account security; aggregate outcomes; explicit uncertainty.\n\n[Data and measurement](../data-and-measurement/README.md)",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "domains",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# D01–D20\n\nNational service and policy domains, each with an observation and feedback record.\n\n[Domain map](../domains/README.md)",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "technology",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Technology\n\nFOSS direction, microservices, Kafka, polyglot services, containers first.\n\n[Technology](../technology/README.md)",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "roadmap",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Roadmap\n\nBlueprint and contracts before implementation; national access, bounded projects.\n\n[Roadmap](../roadmap/README.md)",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 330,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "operating-picture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# National operating picture\n\nDebates, specialists, prices, jobs, agriculture, supply chains, tourism, service hours and delivery outcomes. Prototype data is synthetic; no national feeds are connected.\n\n[System services](../system/operating-picture/README.md)",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
